    "path": "install.md",
    "source": "---\nid: 2DMN4K6F9ZJHHC5Z99MYC8YGEF\ntitle: Install\n---\n\n# Install\n\n::::tabs\n\n:::tab{title=\"Homebrew\"}\n```sh\nbrew install liyasa\n```\n:::\n\n:::tab{title=\"Cargo\"}\n```sh\ncargo install liyasa\n```\n:::\n\n::::\n\nThen run `liyasa --version` to check.\n"
